  "A promise is a promise. In the yard behind the longhouse, your father hands you a wooden sword.": "Una promesa es una promesa. En el patio detrás de la casa larga, tu padre te da una espada de madera.",
  "Speak with your father in the training yard": "Habla con tu padre en el patio de entrenamiento",
